##
## Upstream tests to disable
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# The test hardcodes Chromium's legacy COM GUIDs. Ours come from our Omaha 3
# fork, see chromium_src/chrome/updater/branding.gni. Brave's equivalent is
# BraveLegacyCOMClassesTest.CheckLegacyInterfaceIDs in brave_updater_unittests.
-LegacyCOMClassesTest.CheckLegacyInterfaceIDs

# These tests install a previously released updater, which we don't have yet.
# See GetRealUpdaterLowerVersions() in
# chromium_src/chrome/updater/test/integration_tests_win.cc.
-IntegrationTestDeviceManagement.QualifyUpdaterWhenNextCheckDelayIsZero
-IntegrationTestDeviceManagement.QualifyUpdaterWhenUpdateDisabled
